  <Strings>
    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>296720</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>何だ……！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What the hell...!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>296764</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>これは……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>This is...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>296844</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>これって、&lt;Rody&gt;が
前にしてたペンダント？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Isn't this the pendant you
were always wearing, &lt;Rody&gt;?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>296888</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うん……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>296964</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そう言や、いつの間にか
しなくなってたな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey, now that you mention it, you
stopped wearing that at some point...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>297048</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>マナを吸い込んで、
時の狭間に消えた
はずだった……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It absorbed too much mana
and vanished into some gap
in time, but...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>297100</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なのに、ここに？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But somehow, it's here?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>297200</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>すっかり汚れてるし……
石の色も変わって
金具も錆びちゃってる……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's so filthy... The metal is
all rusted and the stone's
changed color, too...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>297276</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ほんの少しの時間で
こんなになる、かな？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Could it get like this
in such a short time?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>297412</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>たぶん、過去から未来、
すごく長い時間と場所を
さまよって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's probably been drifting
between the past and the
future for a long, long time.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>297412</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>この時間のこの空間に
戻ってきたんだ、きっと</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And then it returned here.
To this time, to this space.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>297472</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Rody&gt;のいるところに？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>To where you are, &lt;Rody&gt;?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>297520</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>偶然すぎね？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Isn't that kinda too
much of a coincidence?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>297608</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>偶然じゃないよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's no coincidence.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>297608</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……戻るべくして
戻ってきたんだ、たぶん</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...It's come back to the place
it's meant to be, probably.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>297672</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ふーん……
よくわかんね……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hmm... I don't
really get it...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>297720</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あ、いたっ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey, that hurt...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>297772</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>お子ちゃま……！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You're such a child!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>297820</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なんだよ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What the hell...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>297936</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ダオス……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Dhaos...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>297936</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>今度はいつまで
一緒にいられるか、
わからないけど……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I don't know how long we'll
be together for this time...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>297936</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>大切に、するよ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But I'll cherish it...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
